Package: osmplaces
Title: Aggregate OpenStreetMap Place Counts for Census Geographies
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("First", "Last", , "you@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Counts OpenStreetMap places (grocery stores, pharmacies, parks,
    and other social-determinants-of-health place types defined in a
    taxonomy) within census tracts, block groups, or ZIP code tabulation
    areas using the ohsome API, for a chosen date.
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: 
    httr2 (>= 1.0.0),
    jsonlite,
    sf,
    stats,
    tigris,
    utils,
    yaml
Suggests: 
    accessibility,
    ggplot2,
    htmlwidgets,
    leaflet,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
